
# Populairty display

(..-5) Our government is <span style="color:#990000;">*languishing*</span> (<span style="color:#990000;">*[+ gov_popularity_npp +]*</span>)
(-4..-3) There is <span style="color:#990000;">*widespread rage*</span> towards our work (<span style="color:#990000;">*[+ gov_popularity_npp +]*</span>)
(-2..-1) We are <span style="color:#DEBD8B;">*barely managing*</span> with our popularity (<span style="color:#DEBD8B;">*[+ gov_popularity_npp +]*</span>)
(0..0) Our constituents in our government are <span style="color:#DEBD8B;">*waiting and seeing*</span>(<span style="color:#DEBD8B;">*[+ gov_popularity_npp +]*</span>)
(1..2) People have an <span style="color:#DEBD8B;">*encouraging*</span> attitude towards our work (<span style="color:#DEBD8B;">*[+ gov_popularity_npp +]*</span>)
(3..4) The public is <span style="color:#008000;">*grateful*</span> with our efforts (<span style="color:#008000;">*[+ gov_popularity_npp +]*</span>)
(5..) The nation is <span style="color:#008000;">*star-struck*</span> with our leftist rule (<span style="color:#008000;">*[+ gov_popularity_npp +]*</span>)
